				"⣿⠀⠀⠀⠀",
				26,
				5
			],
			"Message": "feat(Project): Enable .app bundle resource resolution and normalise Element config formatting\n\nAdvance 5 Land/Element submodules in a coordinated update adding Mountain .app bundle resource resolution across the extension cache, Cocoon entry, and Node sidecar paths, alongside formatting normalisation across four submodules.\n\n**Bundle resource resolution (Mountain):**\n- Extension manifest cache now probes both `BinaryDir/extensions.manifest.json` (dev) and `BinaryDir/../Resources/extensions.manifest.json` (bundle layout), skipping the staleness threshold check for bundled caches.\n- CocoonManagement pre-flight falls back to Tauri's `BaseDirectory::Resource` resolver when the repo-layout path does not exist.\n- NodeResolver TryShipped resolves the `node` binary as a Tauri sidecar sibling of the Mountain executable rather than in a `Node/bin/` subdirectory.\n- ScanPathConfigure canonicalises resolved paths for cleaner logs; `IsTrustedSystemPath` adds `../Resources/Static/Application/extensions` to the bundle-root allowlist.\n- Bootstrap-fork Cocoon entry iterates both bundle (2-level) and repo (3-level) URL bases for candidate entry paths.\n- `tauri.conf.json` maps `bootstrap-fork.js`, `extensions.manifest.json`, and the Cocoon binary into `Contents/Resources/`.\n- `LoadFromCache.rs` refactors per-manifest field extraction with local `str()`/`arr()` closures, eliminating repeated `Manifest.get().and_then(Value::as_str)` chains.\n\n**Style normalisation (Cocoon, Output, Wind, Worker):**\n- Cocoon: Restore tab indentation and trailing commas across all config JS files; reorder imports so re-exports precede local imports; flatten Environment Constant.js named exports.\n- Output: Move `__defProp`/`__name` shims below static import statements to avoid forward-reference hazards; add blank line separators between import groups; normalise expression formatting across all 100+ compiled artifacts.\n- Wind: Convert ESBuild configuration modules from 2-space to tab indentation; local-before-external import ordering; inline export blocks.\n- Worker: Convert ESBuild config from 2-space to hard tabs; expand helpers across multiple lines; add trailing commas.\n\nNo runtime behaviour regressions — all formatting passes produce semantically identical build output.",
			"SHA": "cf11775e5f8c738a139a27a1e891eed033f8542d"
		},
		{
